2. Display books that have never been issued

Logic

Hume BOOK ke saare records lene hain aur dekhna hai ki ISSUE mein unka record hai ya nahi.

Best beginner query:

SELECT b.*
FROM BOOK b
LEFT JOIN ISSUE i
ON b.book_id = i.book_id
WHERE i.book_id IS NULL;

Samjho

LEFT JOIN → BOOK ki saari rows rakhega.

Agar kisi book ka ISSUE record nahi mila, to i.book_id = NULL hoga.

Isliye:

WHERE i.book_id IS NULL

sirf never issued books dega.

Hamare sample data mein:

104 Data Structures
105 Machine Learning

milenge.


