4. Calculate fine for books returned after 15 days

Yahan ek assumption hai: 15 days ke baad ₹2 per day fine.

Tumhare sir ne koi different fine rate diya ho to 2 replace kar dena.

SELECT issue_id,
       book_id,
       member_id,
       issue_date,
       return_date,
       DATEDIFF(return_date, issue_date) AS total_days,

       CASE
           WHEN DATEDIFF(return_date, issue_date) > 15
           THEN (DATEDIFF(return_date, issue_date) - 15) * 2
           ELSE 0
       END AS fine

FROM ISSUE
WHERE return_date IS NOT NULL;

Main concept

DATEDIFF(return_date, issue_date)

→ total kitne days book member ke paas thi.

Suppose:

Issue = 1 Aug
Return = 20 Aug

Difference:

19 days

Allowed:

15 days

Late:

19 - 15 = 4 days

Fine:

4 × ₹2 = ₹8

Sirf late returned books chahiye:

SELECT issue_id,
       book_id,
       member_id,
       issue_date,
       return_date,
       (DATEDIFF(return_date, issue_date) - 15) * 2 AS fine
FROM ISSUE
WHERE return_date IS NOT NULL
AND DATEDIFF(return_date, issue_date) > 15;

Ye exam mein aur clean hai.


