5. Create a procedure to issue a book

Yahi sabse important part hai.

Procedure ka kaam:

member + book lo → check karo book already issue hai ya nahi → agar available hai to issue record insert karo.

CREATE PROCEDURE issue_book(
    IN p_book_id INT,
    IN p_member_id INT
)
BEGIN

    IF EXISTS (
        SELECT 1
        FROM ISSUE
        WHERE book_id = p_book_id
        AND return_date IS NULL
    ) THEN

        SELECT 'Book is already issued' AS message;

    ELSE

        INSERT INTO ISSUE
        (book_id, member_id, issue_date, return_date)
        VALUES
        (p_book_id, p_member_id, CURDATE(), NULL);

        SELECT 'Book issued successfully' AS message;

    END IF;

END;

MySQL stored procedures can use BEGIN ... END blocks containing multiple statements. 

Procedure ko call kaise karenge?

CALL issue_book(104, 3);

Matlab:

Book ID = 104
Member ID = 3

Agar book available hai:

Book issued successfully

phir check:

SELECT * FROM ISSUE;

Tumhe new row milegi.


