⚠️ DB Fiddle mein procedure ka issue

Yahan ek important cheez hai.

Normal MySQL client mein procedure likhte waqt DELIMITER use hota hai, kyunki procedure ke andar ; hote hain. 

Typical MySQL syntax:

DELIMITER $$

CREATE PROCEDURE issue_book(
    IN p_book_id INT,
    IN p_member_id INT
)
BEGIN

    IF EXISTS (
        SELECT 1
        FROM ISSUE
        WHERE book_id = p_book_id
        AND return_date IS NULL
    ) THEN

        SELECT 'Book is already issued' AS message;

    ELSE

        INSERT INTO ISSUE
        (book_id, member_id, issue_date, return_date)
        VALUES
        (p_book_id, p_member_id, CURDATE(), NULL);

        SELECT 'Book issued successfully' AS message;

    END IF;

END $$

DELIMITER ;

But online SQL editors ka delimiter handling alag ho sakta hai. MySQL documentation bhi delimiter ko client-side facility batati hai, SQL statement nahi. 

